# avogadroConstant

- _avogadroConstant(n)_

Answer _n_ times the Avogadro constant Nᴀ,
the number of constituent particles in one mole,
approximately equal to _6.02E23_.

```
>>> 1.avogadroConstant
602214076000000000000000L
```

